                        </button>
                      </div>
                      <div class="text-white/60 text-sm mb-3">Delta Tau Delta Central Office</div>
                      <div class="entry-body">
                        <ul class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-4 list-disc list-outside ml-4 space-y-1">
                          <li>Delivered enterprise-grade Salesforce solutions as sole platform owner at a 35-person nonprofit, managing the full lifecycle from architecture and development to user enablement and data governance.</li>
                          <li>Led the successful migration of 600,000+ constituent and donation records from two legacy CRMs to Salesforce NPSP, ensuring data integrity and system reliability.</li>
                          <li>Managed all technical aspects of Account Engagement (Pardot) platform, optimizing list email segmentation, automation, deliverability and seamless syncing with Salesforce to empower fundraising efforts.</li>
                          <li>Developed and implemented an internal lead scoring engine using Declarative Lookup Rollup Summaries (DLRS) and record-triggered flows to identify high-value fundraising targets based on custom and standard fields.</li>
                          <li>Built and maintained custom objects, flows, reports and dashboards to fully leverage Salesforce data and seamlessly integrate with external systems, including GoFundMe Pro donation platform.</li>
                          <li>Drove user enablement by training staff on Salesforce best practices, creating comprehensive documentation, and establishing standard operating procedures.</li>
                          <li>Upheld rigorous data hygiene standards by implementing duplicate management rules and leveraging third-party enrichment tools.</li>
                          <li>Developed an automated Python script to apply random offset (jitter) to Salesforce Maps data and generate embeddable heatmaps, ensuring data privacy compliance while enabling geographic analysis of constituent records.</li>
                          <li>Managed platform environments utilizing Partial Copy sandboxes for configuration testing, and executed deployment to production using Change Sets.</li>
                        </ul>
                      </div>
                      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#00E5FF] bg-[#00E5FF]/10 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-[#00E5FF]/20">Salesforce Administration</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#00E5FF] bg-[#00E5FF]/10 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-[#00E5FF]/20">Data Management</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#00E5FF] bg-[#00E5FF]/10 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-[#00E5FF]/20">Workflow Automation</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#00E5FF] bg-[#00E5FF]/10 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-[#00E5FF]/20">IT Strategy</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <hr class="bg-white/10" />
                </li>
                <li>
                  <hr class="bg-white/10" />
                  <div class="timeline-middle text-white/30">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.857-9.809a.75.75 0 00-1.214-.882l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 10-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 001.137-.089l4-5.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
